# the unversioned symlinks of the libraries shipped by this package
# exist, but in the mfront-dev and mtest-dev packages, whose semantic
# names lintian cannot relate to the library SONAMEs (the conventional
# names would be libabaqusinterface5.2.0-dev, etc.); the full version
# as SONAME is discussed as an upstream issue in GitHub issue #1466
lacks-unversioned-link-to-shared-library *
package-name-doesnt-match-sonames *
# old lintian versions (up to 2.115) additionally report
# library-not-linked-against-libc for libMFrontGenericParallelRuntime
# and libTFELMathCubicSpline: pure C++ libraries which do not
# reference any libc symbol directly, so the linker (--as-needed)
# drops the libc DT_NEEDED entry; the tag no longer exists in later
# versions of lintian, which makes an override of it an error there.
